Z||000002||WhiteFieroBlur||10-24-2001||11:23 AM||||I went to this audio place to have my system installed and I have a ported box. My box is behind the passanger seat. The box is like the size of the seat. They sell all kicker stuff so this is what he set me up for. A kicker free air 10" sub in a ported box with a 300 watt kicker amp. They say that a ported box if done right sounds better than any sealed box. People tell me all the time about how good it sounds and think I have like 2 12"s in my car and get suprised to only see 1 10".<P> I am not sure if I have a high number with the dbs when I had it check but I am still running crappy cardboard speakers in the factory slots and i hit around 135dbs with my one speaker.||||reg||1
